@host = http://localhost:5080

### Convert meters to feet (POST)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": 100, "fromUnit": "meter", "toUnit": "foot" }

### Celsius to Fahrenheit (GET)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/conversions?value=100&from=C&to=F

### Kilograms to pounds
GET {{host}}/api/v1/conversions?value=70&from=kg&to=lb

### Error: incompatible units
GET {{host}}/api/v1/conversions?value=1&from=meter&to=kg

### Categories
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories

### Units in a category
GET {{host}}/api/v1/units?category=temperature
